I need to create a plan for the app MVP.
This is a fitness tracking app. It supports.

* Taking pictures of scale for weight
* Recording weight in lbs
* If a picture is taken the picture is "unreviewed"
* Reviewing a picture requires inputting the weight into a text box
* Users can review pictures at any time
* Pictures have a time taken from picture metadata
* That helps inform the day-by-day weight tracking

* Users have a weight loss, gain or maintenance goal
* Calculates should be simple and in US units such as those on https://www.calculator.net/macro-calculator.html
* Let users select their goals 0.5/1lb gain/loss a week + target weight

* Taking a picture of food for recording eating
* Same rules as weight scale for recording with "unreviewed"
* Users record macros, description of food, etc
* No meal recording, just timestamp of when it was consumed
* Calculations are against macro goals
* Integrate with a free database for easy lookup of food
* Meals can be associated together

* Goals of meal association is future versions
